# Keep LF everywhere (Biome formats with LF; Windows checkouts would otherwise get CRLF).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
# The demo's sample documents: their bytes as they are, never normalized, and
# never shown through a text converter (Git for Windows' astextplain turns a
# PDF into its text in a diff, and a patch made from that loses the file).
*.pdf binary
*.webp binary
